# builtin-type-of returns the ground TypeValue of a value via ground_typevalue_of (eval.rs).
# T-2110 resolved in S-1014: ground_typevalue_of computes TypeValue from discriminant at call time.
# For Int(42), ground_typevalue_of returns TypeValue.Repr { repr: "Value::Int", is: {} }.
# DisplayVisitor formats a Variant with a dict payload as Variant(Tag, Dict({...})).
[builtin-type-of 42]
=== out
Variant(TypeValue.Repr, Dict({"repr": String("Value::Int"), "is": Dict({})}))
